  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Sri. Siddeshwar Seva Samiti, Haveri, vs The Deputy Commissioner, on 27 August, 2013 Author: H.N.Nagamohan Das",
    "facts": "Petitioner contends that it is a Society registered under the provisions of the Karnataka Societies Registration Act. The petitioner-Society is engaged in supply of drinking water under the name and style of \"Swati Aqua Processed Drinking Water\" to its members. The respondents under the impugned orders at Annexures-N and P seized the drinking water system of the petitioner-Society on the ground that the same is in violation of provisions of the Food Safety and Standard Act, 2006. In furtherance of the same, proceedings are initiated before the respondent-Deputy Commissioner and he has issued a notice as per Annexure-Q dated 13.06.2013. A perusal of Annexure- Q specifies that petitioners are called upon to appear before the respondent-Deputy Commissioner and to submit their explanation.",
